1
00:00:00,639 --> 00:00:02,639
(Penny:)So, how do you want me
to cut it?

2
00:00:02,808 --> 00:00:06,948
(Sheldon:)How about Bill Gates
meets Nikola Tesla?

3
00:00:08,247 --> 00:00:11,027
(Leonard:)So, business in the front,
science in the back.

4
00:00:11,183 --> 00:00:14,593
(Penny:)Or I don't cut it and
maybe just style it a little.

5
00:00:14,753 --> 00:00:16,133
(Sheldon:)I'm in your hands.

6
00:00:16,288 --> 00:00:19,638
(Sheldon:)Do a good job and I'll tell you
Cosmo's ten dynamite tips

7
00:00:19,792 --> 00:00:21,702
(Sheldon:)to enjoy your PMS.

8
00:00:22,861 --> 00:00:24,101
(Penny:)Can you keep him quiet?

9
00:00:24,263 --> 00:00:25,533
(Penny:)Maybe jangle some keys
in front of him?

10
00:00:25,698 --> 00:00:26,938
That doesn't work anymore.

11
00:00:27,099 --> 00:00:29,339
(Leonard:)He just thinks I'm taking him
to the doctor.

12
00:00:31,036 --> 00:00:33,706
(Leonard:)So, now that you're
no longer invested in string theory,

13
00:00:33,872 --> 00:00:35,322
(Leonard:)what are you gonna pursue?

14
00:00:35,474 --> 00:00:37,384
(Sheldon:)There are so

15
00:00:37,543 --> 00:00:40,183
(Sheldon:)black holes, dark matter...

16
00:00:40,346 --> 00:00:42,016
(Penny:)Leonard was telling me
about dark matter,

17
00:00:42,181 --> 00:00:43,391
(Penny:)but I didn't really understand it.

18
00:00:43,549 --> 00:00:46,189
(Sheldon:)Don't feel bad.
Neither does he.

19
00:00:50,189 --> 00:00:52,069
(Sheldon:)OK...

20
00:00:52,624 --> 00:00:54,504
(Penny:)...what do you think?

21
00:00:56,328 --> 00:01:00,018
Have you evr even seen
a picture of Tesla?

